 {"cat": L("Setup", "Setup"), "lvl": L("Fácil", "Easy"), "title": L("Dois Weapon Sets desde cedo", "Two Weapon Sets from early on"), "body": L("Set 1 (spear mais rápida + off hand vazia): Whirling Slash e Barrage. Set 2 (spear de mais dano + Shield→Sceptre depois do Ato 1): Twister, Ice-Tipped Arrows e o Tame Beast. Configure errado e a build simplesmente não funciona como deveria.", "Set 1 (the fastest spear + empty off hand): Whirling Slash and Barrage. Set 2 (the highest-damage spear + Shield→Sceptre after Act 1): Twister, Ice-Tipped Arrows and Tame Beast. Get this wrong and the build simply doesn't work as intended.")},
